Assemblage bundles third-party code.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
purformat  (backend/purformat/)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The .pur reader/writer in backend/purformat/ is taken from the PureRef-format
project by Fyor, which reverse engineered the PureRef binary format:

    https://github.com/FyorDev/PureRef-format

It is used unmodified and is licensed under the MIT License. The full upstream
licence text is preserved at backend/purformat/LICENSE.

    MIT License
    Copyright (c) 2023 Fyor

The row-packing layout algorithm in backend/board_builder.py is adapted from the
`pureref_gen.py` example in the same project.

Assemblage would not exist without this work. Writing a .pur file at all depends
entirely on Fyor having decoded the format first.
